+From: Navid Ghahremani <ghahramani.navid@gmail.com>
+Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: add the ZTE ZX279128S Ethernet driver
+
+Add a driver for the integrated 5-port gigabit switch and DMA engine
+of the ZX279128S.  It programs the packet processor, buffer manager,
+traffic manager and DMA rings, and exposes the four LAN ports as eth0
+and the WAN port as eth1.
+
+Signed-off-by: Navid Ghahremani <ghahramani.navid@gmail.com>
+---
